          "layout": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 86,
            "w": 192,
            "h": 24,
            "i": 14
          },
          "htmlContent": "",
          "markdownContent": "**Needs the collector's own metrics (`otelcol_*`), which are off by default.** Add this under `service:` in the collector config, with the URL, org and token of your OpenObserve exporter, then restart the collector:\n\n```yaml\nservice:\n  telemetry:\n    metrics:\n      readers:\n        - periodic:\n            interval: 30000\n            exporter:\n              otlp:\n                protocol: http/protobuf\n                endpoint: <url>/api/<org>/v1/metrics\n                headers:\n                  Authorization: Basic <token>\n```\n\nChecked on collector 0.115.1. `headers` must be a map, not a `- name:` list; `endpoint` is the full `/api/<org>/v1/metrics` URL."
        }
      ]
    }
